cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you refer to this result, please cite the write-up."
title: "certicom-generators: hidden values shared and reused across standard elliptic-curve generators"
version: "1.0"
abstract: "Dividing each SEC 2 / ANSI X9.62 generator by its cofactor (or by 2) gives structured hidden values on 25 of 69 standard curves; on 18 of them the values are shared between sibling curves, reused from earlier curves, or too uneven to be random."
